  "evidencia": "Page: Progonat. Sentence: Progonat is a village in the former Kurvelesh municipality, Gjirokastër County.\nPage: Progonat. Sentence: At the 2015 local government reform it became part of the municipality Tepelenë.\nPage: Tepelenë. Sentence: Tepelenë (definite Albanian form: \"Tepelena\" ) is a town and a municipality in Gjirokastër County, in the south of Albania.\nPage: Tepelenë. Sentence: The town is located on the left bank of the Vjosa River, about three kilometres downstream from its union with the Drino.\nPage: Ismet Toto. Sentence: Ismet Toto (Progonat, 1908 - Gjirokastër, 1937) was an Albanian bureaucrat, publicist, writer and revolutionary.",
